# Healthcare Booking - environment reference
#
# Only server/.env is required to run locally (see README.md for the full walkthrough).

## Server (`server/.env`)
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER@localhost:5432/healthcare_booking?schema=public"
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://USER@localhost:5432/healthcare_booking?schema=public"
JWT_SECRET="change-me-in-production"
OPENAI_API_KEY=""
OPENAI_MODEL="gpt-4o-mini"
OPENAI_MODEL_ADMIN=""
# AgentRouter is tried first (free/pooled proxy); OpenAI above is the fallback.
# Leave both keys empty to use the built-in heuristic AI.
AGENTROUTER_API_KEY=""
AGENTROUTER_BASE_URL="https://agentrouter.org/v1"
AGENTROUTER_MODEL="deepseek-v4-flash"
AGENTROUTER_MODEL_ADMIN=""
AGENTROUTER_USER_AGENT="claude-cli/1.0.0 (external, cli)"
PORT=4100
HOST=0.0.0.0

## App (`app/.env`) - only needed to run Expo on a physical phone
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://YOUR_COMPUTERS_LAN_IP:4100